WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.269
Claude can now

00:00:01.081 --> 00:00:01.694
review

00:00:01.765 --> 00:00:02.838
fix and approve

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.451
PRs

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.169
Anthropic launched

00:00:04.981 --> 00:00:05.923
Claude Ship in

00:00:05.735 --> 00:00:06.336
beta

00:00:06.475 --> 00:00:07.607
It combines Code

00:00:07.419 --> 00:00:08.385
Review with two

00:00:08.197 --> 00:00:09.046
new agents

00:00:09.129 --> 00:00:10.425
PR Steward and

00:00:10.237 --> 00:00:11.310
Claude Approvals

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.233
PR Steward fixes

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:13.952
failing checks

00:00:13.988 --> 00:00:15.249
merge conflicts and

00:00:15.061 --> 00:00:16.299
review feedback but

00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:17.171
never merges

00:00:17.311 --> 00:00:18.655
Claude Approvals approves

00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:19.940
routine changes based

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:20.612
on a policy

00:00:20.424 --> 00:00:21.096
file in the

00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:21.567
repo

00:00:22.094 --> 00:00:22.872
On the Claude

00:00:22.684 --> 00:00:23.426
Code team

00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:25.065
merged pull requests

00:00:24.877 --> 00:00:25.843
more than doubled

00:00:25.655 --> 00:00:26.410
from June to

00:00:26.221 --> 00:00:27.058
September

00:00:27.106 --> 00:00:27.978
while the share

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:28.933
reverted fell by

00:00:28.745 --> 00:00:30.171
over 40 percent

00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:31.716
Full story on

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:32.423
the dashboard
